      "arc.apex_px 88 / launch_angle_deg 18": "launchAngle = 18.0\u00b0 is VERIFIED (.arz); apex is DERIVED ballistically as range\u00b7tan(18\u00b0)/4 = 1083 \u00d7 0.3249 / 4. The prior 180 px had no source.",
      "field.radius_px 181 / field_diameter 2.78 BH": "Legolas Table B \u00a72 per-rank table \u2014 RANK 1: projectileExplosionRadius 2.5 m = 2.78 BH diameter (VERIFIED). Rank 12 = 6.44 BH, rank 22 = 7.11 BH; this spec declares RANK 1.",
