      "burn_dot_s 3.0": "Legolas \u00a74 \u2014 burn duration is a FLAT 3.0 s regardless of rank and is a DIFFERENT CLOCK from the pool duration (VERIFIED). The prior spec conflated the two.",
      "bounce false": "HOUSE \u2014 the source flask IS a physics body that can bounce (physicsRestitution 1.0, physicsFriction 16.0, dedicated bounce sound, VERIFIED). We author a clean arc-and-shatter for E3-r1; bounce is a declared deviation, re-openable.",
