      "residue form + residue_diameter": "Legolas \u00a712.1 row 4c \u2014 MEASURED, form MED / BH LOW (\u22484.3 BH at that clip's unknown rank; scaled here to rank 1's 2.78 BH field \u00d7 the same ~1.15 residue:field ratio \u2192 3.2 BH, DERIVED)",
      "field form (boiling disc, white-hot centre, short tongues)": "Legolas \u00a712.1 row 4c \u2014 MEASURED, MED",
      "lick_flicker_hz 3.3\u20133.6, low coherence": "Legolas \u00a712.1 row 4b \u2014 MEASURED, MED: autocorrelation over 200 frames @60 fps gives a \u22480.28\u20130.30 s characteristic period at +0.10 to +0.25 coherence. Emphatically NOT the 1 Hz damage tick.",
      "impact ground ring + bloom + streaks": "Legolas \u00a712.1 row 4a \u2014 MEASURED (form)",
      "3 glass shards": "HOUSE \u2014 STILL UNKNOWN at source. \u00a712.5: footage tried at 1080p/60 and FAILED; the remaining route is the .pfx inside the packed .arc. Retained as a house choice, not a source fact.",
